<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1F14', padding: 0 }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 0, top: 0, width: 500, height: 720, background: '#056526', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.6)', letterSpacing: 3 }}>CHAPTER</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 230, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A4DA22', lineHeight: 1, letterSpacing: 2, marginTop: 4 }}>03</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.6)', letterSpacing: 3, marginTop: 10 }}>OF 04</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 0, width: 560, height: 720, justifyContent: 'center' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 600, color: '#A4DA22', letterSpacing: 2.6 }}>WHO IT SERVES</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 62, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F5F8F2', lineHeight: 1.1, letterSpacing: -0.8, marginTop: 16 }}>Three roles,<br />three sightlines</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 3, background: '#A4DA22', marginTop: 26, marginBottom: 24 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.72)', lineHeight: 1.65, width: 480 }}>
      A farmer, an agriculture officer, an administrator. Each sees a different slice of the same data — and the slice is enforced by the database, not the menu.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, marginTop: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 3, background: '#A4DA22' }} />
      <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 21, fontStyle: 'italic', color: '#F5F8F2', lineHeight: 1.55, width: 460 }}>
          Hiding a button is not a permission. Every read and write is filtered by row-level security before it leaves the server.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.55)', marginTop: 12 }}>The rule the whole chapter rests on</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginTop: 40, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(245,248,242,0.22)', paddingTop: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(245,248,242,0.55)', letterSpacing: 2 }}>UP NEXT</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Segoe UI', fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F8F2' }}>The farmer workspace · pages 11–13</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>
</Slide>
